='116' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>再做辅助对齐</text><text x='337.5' y='146' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>模型提议 + 人工确认</text><path d='M445 105 l14 0' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M459 105 l-7 -5 l0 10 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='462' y='30' width='213' height='150' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='462' y='30' width='213' height='6' rx='3' fill='#0E2340'/><circle cx='488' cy='66' r='16' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='488' y='72' font-size='16' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>3</text><text x='568.5' y='116' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>积累高质量标注</text><text x='568.5' y='146' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>错因需注明证据来源</text><path d='M676 105 l14 0' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M690 105 l-7 -5 l0 10 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='693' y='30' width='213' height='150' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='693' y='30' width='213' height='6' rx='3' fill='#0E2340'/><circle cx='719' cy='66' r='16' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='719' y='72' font-size='16' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>4</text><text x='799.5' y='116' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>先验证时间增益</text><text x='799.5' y='146' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>三组对照实验</text><path d='M907 105 l14 0' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M921 105 l-7 -5 l0 10 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='924' y='30' width='213' height='150' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='924' y='30' width='213' height='6' rx='3' fill='#0E2340'/><circle cx='950' cy='66' r='16' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='950' y='72' font-size='16' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>5</text><text x='1030.5' y='116' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>有证据后再训练</text><text x='1030.5' y='146' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>先形成评测集</text><path d='M40 200 L1100 200' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2' stroke-dasharray='5 5'/><path d='M40 200 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#00A9B5'/><text x='570.0' y='226' font-size='15' fill='#00A9B5' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>阶段之间可回退：变式暴露某步不会 → 返回该步训练</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E7BE0', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>合成笔迹可以测试回放和流程，不能代替真实学生思考过程的数据；评价须按学生和题目划分数据，防止同人同题泄漏</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：单题功能设计思路.md §3.5</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 29 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>